prison-chat-join-message = You have an active prison server ban. You may freely remain an observer. Attempting to enter the round opens faction selection for { $seconds } seconds, after which you are assigned automatically. While your living character is in the correctional zone, a temporary sentence runs { $percent }% faster. The first kill of each opposing prisoner per round reduces it by { $minutes } minutes; killing an ally increases it.
prison-sent-message = You have been assigned to the correctional zone. Remaining sentence: { $remaining } minutes. Choose a faction within { $seconds } seconds or be assigned automatically. While you are alive in the zone, your sentence runs { $percent }% faster. The first kill of each opposing prisoner per round reduces it by { $minutes } minutes; killing an ally increases it.
prison-sent-permanent-message = You have been assigned to the correctional zone. Choose a faction within { $seconds } seconds or be assigned automatically. A permanent sentence cannot be reduced; killing another prisoner revokes prison access.
prison-arrival-message = You have arrived in the correctional zone. While you are alive here, a temporary sentence runs { $percent }% faster. Fauna and local ore deliveries reduce it; the first kill of each opposing prisoner per round reduces it by { $minutes } minutes. Killing an ally increases it.
prison-unavailable-message = Prison is not available right now. Try again later.
prison-release-message = Your prison server ban is no longer active. Prison restrictions have been lifted.
prison-ooc-blocked = You cannot use OOC while serving a prison sentence.
prison-ghost-chat-blocked = You cannot use ghost chat while serving a prison sentence.
prison-bwoink-blocked = You cannot use adminhelp while serving a prison sentence.
prison-ghost-role-blocked = You cannot take ghost roles while serving a prison sentence.
prison-antag-role-blocked = You cannot become an antagonist while serving a prison sentence.
prison-arena-blocked = Prisoners cannot participate in the ghost arena.
prison-murder-penalty-reason = Murdered another prisoner while serving a prison sentence.
prison-murder-penalty-message = You killed another prisoner. Your sentence was increased by { $minutes } minutes.
prison-murder-permanent-message = You killed another prisoner. Your access to the prison area has been revoked.
prison-fauna-reward-message = Your sentence was reduced by { $minutes } minutes for eliminating dangerous fauna.
prison-cross-faction-kill-reward-message = Your sentence was reduced by { $minutes } minutes for killing a prisoner from another faction.
prison-faction-selected-message = You joined the { $faction } faction. This choice lasts until the end of the round.
prison-faction-examine = Faction: [color=orange]{ $faction }[/color].
prison-faction-window-title = Choose faction
prison-faction-window-timer = Auto-select in { $seconds } sec.
prison-faction-window-confirm = Join
prison-faction-slag-name = Slag Collective
prison-faction-slag-feature = Ore extraction, meson glasses, GPS, and an orange-brown uniform.
prison-faction-frontier-name = Frontier Watch
prison-faction-frontier-feature = Fauna hunting, protective jacket, survival knife, and a maroon-black uniform.
prison-ore-not-prisoner = Only prisoners may register ore for sentence reduction.
prison-ore-unpowered = The ore intake is unpowered.
prison-ore-no-eligible-ore = There is no ore mined in the correctional zone to accept.
prison-ore-no-temporary-sentence = Your current sentence cannot be reduced.
prison-ore-no-cargo-space = Cargo cannot accept a prison shipment right now. The ore was not consumed.
prison-ore-deposit-accepted = Accepted { $units } ore units. Delivery is worth { $seconds } seconds.
prison-ore-reward-message = Your sentence was reduced by { $seconds } seconds after the prison ore shipment arrived.
prison-ore-processor-examine = It only accepts ore mined from veins in the correctional zone. Credit is granted after cargo returns it to the station.
prison-ore-crate-description = An ordinary cargo crate containing { $units } units of correctional-zone ore.
prison-ore-loose-description = { $units } units of correctional-zone ore awaiting delivery to the station.
prison-ore-loose-delivered-description = { $units } units of delivered correctional-zone ore.
prison-ore-shipment-pending = This stack contains { $units } registered ore units awaiting delivery.
prison-ore-shipment-delivered = The delivered shipment contains { $units } ore units.
